# Job Tailor — ATS resume engine

When the user pastes a job description (JD), asks to tailor a resume, or asks for an ATS Markdown/HTML pack, generate the resume immediately from the vault. Do not wait for extra confirmation unless the vault is missing.

Default public title (header, unless the user supplies a contractual title from the vault): **توسعه‌دهنده فول‌استک .NET و معمار نرم‌افزار | Full-Stack .NET Developer & Software Architect**.

Follow `.cursor/rules/career-engine.mdc` (۸ اصل طلایی، Show Don't Tell، X-Y-Z) and `.cursor/skills/generate-ats-pdf/print-template.html` for print CSS. Tone: `.cursor/skills/humanizer/SKILL.md`. Persian: professional engineer register, not bookish AI.

## Trigger

Apply when any of these happen:

- A JD is pasted in chat (English or Persian).
- The user asks for a tailored / ATS / printable resume.
- Files under `career-hub/tailored-resumes/` are being created or rewritten for a target role.

## Employment-status integrity (ATS / background check)

Never present overlapping roles as two full-time jobs.

| Role file | Label on every tailored resume |
| --- | --- |
| `06-ertebatat-pazhouhan.md` | Primary official full-time, On-site/Hybrid, Tir 1404 – end of Tir 1405 |
| `07-ayar-plus.md` | Part-time / Remote Contractor; hours outside Pazhoohan commitments; no conflict of interest, no commercial competition, no contractual bar |

Do not copy Senior, Junior, Mid-level, Lead-as-rank, ارشد, or لید onto the header. BahamShop may keep `راهبر فنی` / Technical Lead only as the vault functional role for that job, never as the profile headline.

## Pipeline

### 1. Analyze the JD

Extract and keep a short internal list (do not dump it into the resume):

- Stack and tools (languages, frameworks, cloud, messaging, mobile).
- Architecture words (Clean Architecture, DDD, CQRS, Microservices, Onion).
- Domain (transport, gold/ERP, electricity, search, automation, AI/CV).
- Commercial concerns (scale, uptime, settlement, offline operations, delivery speed).
- Requested rank: note it to understand the brief; do not copy it onto the resume title.

### 2. Read the vault (required)

Read every file under:

- `career-hub/experiences/`
- `career-hub/education/`
- `career-hub/certificates/` (`certificates.md` and `assets/`)

Contact defaults if the vault omits them: Shiraz, Iran · +98 933 229 7757 · mv6468@gmail.com · mohammadrezav.ir · linkedin.com/in/sirtype · github.com/SirTypeOfficial.

If `career-hub/` is empty, stop. Do not invent a resume from `index.html` or site JSON.

### 3. Match experiences (no invention)

Select duties, stack, dates, employers, and metrics only from the vault. If the JD asks for Kubernetes, Pine Script as a headline skill, or any stack not in the vault, omit it. Do not fabricate employers, dates, certificates, or numbers.

### 4. Recency Effect (70%)

About 70% of resume length and emphasis stays on the last three to four years:

1. Ayar Plus (`07`)
2. Ertebatat Pazhoohan Matin (`06`)
3. BahamShop (`05`)

Nikan (`01`) and Rasta (`02`) stay short foundation lines. ParsiaAfzar (`03`) and independent work (`04`) appear only when they overlap the JD (Microservices, CQRS, RabbitMQ, n8n, MQL5). Drop off-stack roles instead of padding. Rank 01–07 by overlap, then still weight 05–07 more heavily.

### 5. Rewrite bullets as Google X-Y-Z

Each bullet: accomplished **X**, measured by **Y**, by doing **Z**. Architectural verbs: Architected, Engineered, Optimized, Containerized, Designed, Shipped. No passive adjacent verbs («همکاری در», "helped the team"). No invented metrics. No banned filler (spearheaded, cutting-edge, game-changer, synergy, robust-as-fluff, and the career-engine Persian list).

Mirror JD keywords only when they are true in the vault.

Language: user request wins; else match the JD (`en` or `fa`). Keep the same facts in both languages if two packs are requested.

### 6. Write two clean files

Slug `[Company]` and `[Role]` to ASCII kebab-case. `[Lang]` is `en` or `fa`. Do not put Senior in a filename unless it is the vault contractual title.

```text
career-hub/tailored-resumes/[Company]-[Role]-[Lang].md
career-hub/tailored-resumes/[Company]-[Role]-[Lang].html
```

Examples: `Snapp-FullStack-NET-en.md`, `AyarPlus-MAUI-Contractor-fa.html`.

Move superseded drafts of the same company-role-lang triple to `career-hub/tailored-resumes/archive/`.

## Markdown (ATS)

Single column. No tables, icons, badges, columns, or text-in-images. One to two pages.

```markdown
# Mohammad Reza Vazifeh
[Functional title tailored to the JD — never a self-proclaimed seniority rank]
Shiraz, Iran | +98 933 229 7757 | mv6468@gmail.com | mohammadrezav.ir | linkedin.com/in/sirtype | github.com/SirTypeOfficial

## Professional Summary
[3–4 lines. Functional title + JD-matched stack. One vault-backed proof.]

## Core Competencies
**Languages:** …
**Backend:** …
**Architecture:** …
**Data / Messaging:** …
**Frontend / Mobile:** …
**Cloud / DevOps:** …

## Key Technical Experience
### [Role] | [Company]
[City, Country] | [Mon YYYY – Mon YYYY]
- [X-Y-Z]
- [X-Y-Z]

## Flagship Projects
### [Project]
- [X-Y-Z tied to the JD]

## Certifications
- [Name] | [Issuer] | [Year]

## Education
- [Item], [Institute] | [Year]
```

Persian section order (same facts): مشخصات، خلاصه حرفه‌ای، شایستگی‌های اصلی، تجربه فنی کلیدی، پروژه‌های شاخص، مدارک، تحصیلات.

On overlapping 06/07 rows, put employment type in the role line or the first meta line (`Full-time / On-site-Hybrid` vs `Part-time / Remote Contractor`).

Certifications only from `certificates.md`. Education only from `career-hub/education/00-training-path.md`.

## HTML (printable A4, ATS-safe)

Create a standalone HTML file next to the Markdown. Same content, same section order.

- `<html lang="en" dir="ltr">` or `<html lang="fa" dir="rtl">`.
- Isolated A4: `@page { size: A4; margin: 14mm 16mm; }`. Single column. Ink on white.
- English font: `Inter, Arial, "Helvetica Neue", Helvetica, sans-serif`.
- Persian font: `Vazirmatn, Tahoma, "Segoe UI", sans-serif`.
- Load fonts with a Google Fonts `<link>` (Inter and/or Vazirmatn). No icon fonts.
- No cards, logos, photos, colored boxes, two-column layouts, SVG charts, or background graphics. One 1px hairline under `h2` is the only decoration.
- Real text nodes only (selectable PDF after Print).
- Start from `.cursor/skills/generate-ats-pdf/print-template.html`, then switch `body` font-family to Vazirmatn when `dir="rtl"`.

After writing both files, tell the user to open the HTML in a browser: Print → Save as PDF (A4, headers/footers off).

